 succeeded in 0ms:
verification.k	58	rule	-	PROOF_LOCAL_MANUAL_ACCEPT	rule exchangeDef => FuncDef( "exchange", Params("lst1", "lst2"), Assign(Name("odd"), Int(0)) Assign(Name("even"), Int(0)) Assign(Name("number"), Int(0)) For(Name("number"), Name("lst1"), ODD-BODY) For(Name("number"), Name("lst2"), EVEN-BODY) If(Compare(Name("odd"), CmpOp("<=", Name("even"))), Return(Str("YES")), .Stmts) Return(Str("NO")))
verification.k	71	endmodule	-	PROOF_LOCAL_MANUAL_ACCEPT	endmodule
spec.k	3	module	-	CLAIM_MANUAL_REVIEW	module EXCHANGE-SPEC
